INTERFACE
The Hermes Desktop interface (Nous Research) is redrawn in HTML/CSS to show the CipherVault plugin running inside it.
No screenshots, footage or logos of Hermes are used; the wordmark is not shown. The CipherVault pane, tool names, JSON
fields, guard messages and CLI output are copied from this repository's source (plugins/ciphervault, apps/cli).
The vault mascot is an original pixel character made for this film. All secrets on screen are fake (test_value_123456).

TOOLS
Rendered entirely in code with the Lemo-Opuscar toolkit (MIT, github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), headless Chromium
(Playwright) and ffmpeg. No video-generation model and no stock footage.
